    "text": "11 hours ago After a successful Pan Continental Curling Championships (PCCC) in northern Minnesota last season, the national organization is pleased to announce the Senior Men’s & Women’s Nationals, a championship for curlers over the age of 50 that sends representatives to the World Senior Men’s & Women’s Championships, will be at Curl Mesabi from February 7-14, 2027. Read full article",
